                 distribute the load across a pool of servers.  This function
                 is known as _L_S_N_A_T (RFC 2391).  For example, the argument

                       _t_c_p _w_w_w_1_:_h_t_t_p_,_w_w_w_2_:_h_t_t_p_,_w_w_w_3_:_h_t_t_p _w_w_w_:_h_t_t_p

