                 --pprrooxxyy__oonnllyy option is not specified.  The specified address
                 is usually the address assigned to the “public” network in‐
                 terface.

                 All data passing _o_u_t will be rewritten with a source address
                 equal to _a_d_d_r_e_s_s.  All data coming _i_n will be checked to see
                 if it matches any already-aliased outgoing connection.  If it
                 does, the packet is altered accordingly.  If not, all
