                 it will be sent to the specified _a_d_d_r_e_s_s.

                 The target address may be set to _2_5_5_._2_5_5_._2_5_5_._2_5_5, in which
                 case all new incoming packets go to the alias address set by
                 --aalliiaass__aaddddrreessss or --iinntteerrffaaccee.

                 If this option is not used, or called with the argument
